@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the KMT to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 8; right_dissent += 3

We have increased the strength of the left faction with the CPC. This raised concern among the rightists in the party.

@cpc_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the CPC
subtitle: Cooperating with the Communists is the main goal of Soong Ching-ling's left faction.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if cpc_civil_war = 1 : The Communists don't trust us anymore.?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and cpc_civil_war = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; cpc_relation += 6*(1-dissent); right_dissent += 3;

Soong Ching-ling has continued Sun Yat-sen's united front with Soviet assistance.

@organize_women
title: Organizing Women
